    "detailed_description": "Ninja Simulator Prologue is the first combat mission where you can test your skills as a real Ninja!<br>In this free prologue version you will check all the important aspects of our game, such as:<br>A great combat system divided into melee and ranged combat<br>Stealth system<br>Amazing finishers and stealth kills<br>You will check out some fantastic character moves such as backflip and demon dash.<br>Mechanics of grappling hook<br>and many others!<br><br>Check out the heavy and dirty atmosphere of feudal Japan through the eyes of Shinobi who got involved in an incredible plot!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692950/extras/539dd4946f6d86b31d50f873e827e973.webp?t=1727001606\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Be like a ghost</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692950/extras/6dc28edad5b755010945fe167f154299.poster.avif?t=1727001606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692950/extras/6dc28edad5b755010945fe167f154299.webm?t=1727001606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692950/extras/6dc28edad5b755010945fe167f154299.mp4?t=1727001606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Take on impossible challenges</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692950/extras/e9166d94cc5209902ba3720ad2b64665.poster.avif?t=1727001606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692950/extras/e9166d94cc5209902ba3720ad2b64665.webm?t=1727001606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam